Copying APOD Basic HTML
Best option:
Find the APOD date code, such as 140918.
Open /wp-json/wp/v2/apod-basic/140918/html.
Copy the HTML from the page.
RSS option:
Open /feed/apod-basic/.
Find the item you need.
Copy the HTML inside content:encoded.
JSON option:
Open /wp-json/wp/v2/apod-basic/140918.
Copy basic_html only if the receiving tool understands JSON string escaping.
If the HTML contains \u003C or \n, use the raw HTML route instead.
