Troubleshooting
If the RSS feed returns a 404 but JSON works, the plugin may be active but WordPress rewrite rules may need to be flushed.
If basic_html looks full of escaped characters in JSON, that is normal. Use the raw HTML route or the RSS content:encoded field for copy/paste HTML.
If explanation or description is empty, check that the APOD post has explanation text in the Media Detail Hero data source.
If the RSS feed only returns one item, check the filters and confirm there are published APOD posts for that date range.
If hdurl is empty, check that the post has a featured image with a full-size image URL.
